# Copy to .prepublish_identities and add one identity per line.
# .prepublish_identities is gitignored; do not commit real names or hosts.
#
# Include:
# - your Mac username
# - your Hugging Face username
# - Spark / lab hostnames (short name and MagicDNS, if any)
#
# The scan also auto-detects the current login, hostnames, and non-secret
# values from .env (SPARK_HOST, SPARK_USER, SPARK_PROJECT_DIR) at run time.
# Those detected values are never written into the report in plaintext.

# YOUR_MAC_USERNAME
# YOUR_HF_USERNAME
# YOUR_SPARK_HOSTNAME
